    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "wSDgv",
      "x": 4544,
      "y": 19500,
      "name": "COMPARE · levels · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Gv6wA",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOW COMPARE PLAYS AT EACH LEVEL",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Qn7Ht",
          "name": "The bar · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One board, three levels",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bQ8yD",
          "name": "The bar · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every level uses the same board: two dinosaur cards, VS between them, and the question with its symbol above. The levels differ only in which questions a round asks. Each level keeps its own best, shown at the top right.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n3UyP",
          "name": "The board · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Hatchling",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "XmPJC",
          "name": "The board · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "WHO IS HEAVIER? (scale) and WHO IS TALLER? (ruler). This is today's quiz, kept unchanged as the easiest level. Height is hip height.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Erd5n",
          "name": "The question · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Explorer",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Q9Tkma",
          "name": "The question · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Adds WHO IS LONGER? (left-right arrow). The value chip uses the question's own symbol, so a length chip shows the arrow and a height chip shows the ruler.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DnofT",
          "name": "Finds · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Paleontologist",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IaIKM",
          "name": "Finds · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Adds the reverse questions WHO IS LIGHTER? (feather) and WHO IS SHORTER? (arrow down). The pick that wins is the smaller one, and the ✓ and ✗ marks work the same way.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Wkk2u",
          "name": "The reveal · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Answer and last question",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Kmvtc",
          "name": "The reveal · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A right pick gets ✓ and NEXT. A wrong pick gets ✗, the right card gets ✓, and that step on the progress bar turns red. On question 10, SEE RESULT with a trophy takes the place of NEXT.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ysw6Y",
          "name": "FIELD GUIDE · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Loading and result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rXqIN",
          "name": "FIELD GUIDE · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The progress shows at once and the pictures shimmer until they load; the values and NEXT appear only after a pick. The result shows the level switch with the round's level chosen. A first best (4 on a new level) is celebrated as FIRST BEST!. Switching level leaves the result and starts no round.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QXDGV",
          "name": "Dark · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every device, dark and Russian",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NHpNg",
          "name": "Dark · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each new question kind is drawn on the iPad on its side, the iPad upright, the iPhone, the iPhone on its side and the iPhone SE, with dark and Russian frames. In Russian, VS reads ИЛИ, NEXT reads ДАЛЬШЕ, SEE RESULT reads РЕЗУЛЬТАТ, FIRST BEST! reads ПЕРВЫЙ РЕКОРД!, and values use a decimal comma: 3,1 М. On the iPad upright the bar's steps narrow to fit ДОМОЙ and 10 / 10.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
