          "content": "A loading picture shimmers at its size, its name below. A picture that fails shows footprints, its name still below.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "w1YIDw",
          "name": "Result · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kX8Nt",
          "name": "Result · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The compare quiz's result: n / 6, 8 or 10 with that many stars, the right ones won; WELL DONE!; FIRST BEST!, NEW BEST! (celebrated) or BEST (no celebration, also for a first round of 0). The level switch, then PLAY AGAIN and HOME. Phones: the level switch as pictures alone, PLAY AGAIN over HOME.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Krbqx",
          "name": "Sizes · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Sizes",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "y1On2E",
          "name": "Sizes · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "iPad upright: tray 2 rows of 3 at 200, 4 at 158, 5 at 123; baskets side by side, mark above name, one name size per window from the longest word in either language (at most 34, 28 for three baskets, never under 16). Phone: tray 2×3 at 112, 2×4 or 3×4 at 82, baskets 8 apart, never under 72 wide; the iPhone SE Paleontologist board scrolls.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zfWqU",
          "name": "Motion · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WbdWg",
          "name": "Motion · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The board rises in; a card lifts on pick-up and settles on put-down; the lit basket fades in; a right card lands and its ✓ pops, its step fills; a wrong card slides back, then the hint pops and the basket glows; SEE RESULT rises in. With reduced motion every one of these is a short fade.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
