    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "eDplA",
      "x": 7500,
      "y": 45000,
      "name": "CARE · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wUcnz",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOW CARE PLAYS",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Of7hD",
          "name": "Levels · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Levels",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oey9C",
          "name": "Levels · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One mode at every age level, so CARE has no level switch. Hatchling, Explorer and Paleontologist all play the need-bubble visit.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cjfpd",
          "name": "Welcome · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Welcome",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WFWiU",
          "name": "Welcome · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The title CARE with the heart mark, and the best chip in hearts out of 8. The New visitor card shows a visitor at the door with a knock bubble, then NEW VISITOR. The Friends card shows up to five faces and an empty place, then FRIENDS with the friend count. A first visit shows no best chip and an empty friends card.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HY2vm",
          "name": "Needs · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Needs",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LI36q",
          "name": "Needs · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A visitor has four needs, always in this order: hungry, thirsty, dirty, tired. The needs row shows them as symbols. The current need is larger and orange, a met one is green with a check, a later one is quiet. The thought bubble shows what helps: a bowl, water, a bath, a nest with a moon.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FYRyM",
          "name": "Tray · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tray",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "V82jH8",
          "name": "Tray · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Five items: plants, meat, water, bath, nest. Each is a picture with its word, and on phones the picture alone, its word the screen-reader name. While the visitor reacts, the tray dims and takes no taps.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "J1XOJ8",
          "name": "Right item · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Right item",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rg7C6",
          "name": "Right item · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The item flies to the visitor, who eats, drinks, bathes or sleeps. The need turns green and hearts pop by the bubble: 2 on the first try, 1 after a wrong one.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g1iKht",
          "name": "Wrong item · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Wrong item",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ls6iF",
          "name": "Wrong item · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The visitor turns its head away and no heart is lost. The bubble then shows the item that helps, the tray rings it in orange, and the refused item fades until the need is met.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "M2PqA",
          "name": "Leaving · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Leaving",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ugtvB",
          "name": "Leaving · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "With all four needs met, the visitor dances with hearts and walks off, and the result follows. A visit earns 4 to 8 hearts.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LO5aw",
          "name": "Visitor picture · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Visitor picture",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TIxIR",
          "name": "Visitor picture · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "While it loads, a shimmer holds its place. If it fails, a symbol stands in. The visit still plays, since the needs, bubbles and items do not depend on it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "urcb6",
          "name": "Result · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "F1UNM0",
          "name": "Result · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The score n / 8, with eight hearts. NEW FRIEND! the first time this dinosaur visits, WELL DONE! when it comes back; the friend chip names it. The best chip shows FIRST BEST!, NEW BEST! with the beaten number struck, or BEST n. Only a first or new best gets the celebration. If progress cannot be read, the best chip hides. Buttons: NEW VISITOR, FRIENDS, HOME.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u33OU7",
          "name": "Friends · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Friends",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RfiuO",
          "name": "Friends · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every dinosaur that has visited, as a card with its picture and name. BACK, the count and HOME sit on top, NEW VISITOR under the title. A long list scrolls; a loading picture shimmers and a failed one shows a symbol with the name. With no friends: an empty nest, an invite and NEW VISITOR.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kXYJl",
          "name": "Phones · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Phones",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D0Pl5",
          "name": "Phones · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOME and BACK are round symbols, and titles are words alone. On FRIENDS the title hides, and BACK, count and HOME share the bar. Tray items are pictures alone, at least 44 wide. Result: NEW VISITOR full width, then FRIENDS beside a round HOME, with the hearts in one row. On the iPhone SE the result scrolls as a whole page. On an upright iPad the result buttons are stacked.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DqbhC",
          "name": "Motion · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z3nQg",
          "name": "Motion · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The visitor walks in and out, the item flies, the need fills in, hearts pop and count up, the result rises. Under reduced motion, all of these are short fades.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QgsUd",
          "name": "Suggested choices · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Suggested choices",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z9gNC",
          "name": "Suggested choices · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A wrong item costs no heart, so trying is never punished. Eight hearts per visit at most matches the best chip's / 8. Friends appear in the order they first visited.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
